## What is covered

The adjudicated gold-standard labels and the per-rater verdicts are this project's own work
product. Two raters researched publicly available sources against a written protocol, an
adjudicator resolved their disagreements, and the resulting judgements — the category, the
institution, the determination and the rationale — were recorded here. These judgements are
licensed as above.

## What is not covered

**Verbatim quotations from third-party sources.** The evidence files record, for each verdict, the
source URL and the exact sentence the rater relied on. Those sentences remain the property of their
original publishers — club official sites, league and federation sites, news outlets, schools, and
Japanese Wikipedia. They are reproduced here as short quotations for the purpose of verification,
each attributed to its source by URL, and subordinate to the dataset in which they appear. They are
not relicensed by this file, and reuse of a quotation on its own is governed by its own source's
terms.

Quotations drawn from Japanese Wikipedia are additionally subject to CC BY-SA 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/) and should be attributed to Wikipedia when reused
as text.

**Raw appearance records are not included in this repository at all.** They were obtained from the
J.League Data Site, whose terms prohibit unauthorised reproduction, and are therefore not
redistributed. The collection scripts in `scripts/` allow them to be re-derived from the source.
See `docs/source_audit_jleague_data_site.md` for the full terms audit.
